                  "description": {
                    "value": "You replicate the attack of a deadly purple worm. You deal 3d6 piercing damage to the touched creature and afflict it with purple worm venom. The target must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes 3d6 poison damage.\n- **Failure:** The target is afflicted with purple worm venom at stage 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is afflicted with purple worm venom at stage 2.\n\n**Purple Worm Venom**\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds\n- Stage 1: 3d6 poison damage and enfeebled 2 (1 round)\n- Stage 2: 4d6 poison damage and enfeebled 2 (1 round)\n- Stage 3: 6d6 poison damage and enfeebled 2 (1 round)"
